  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "What will be the effect on the root mean square velocity of oxygen molecules if the temperature is doubled and oxygen molecule dissociates into atomic oxygen?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "HEEu3",
      "text": "The velocity of atomic oxygen remains same",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jHgtl",
      "text": "The velocity of atomic oxygen doubles",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pi475",
      "text": "The velocity of atomic oxygen becomes half",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ETrfX",
      "text": "The velocity of atomic oxygen becomes four times",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The RMS velocity of a gas is given by, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;dissociates into <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;its&nbsp;molecular mass becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore,</p><p>Ratio of RMS&nbsp;speed,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></msqrt></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
